1.1.0

- Converts PIP-CO Startup Systems to a modular optional-startup system.
- Adds dynamic category and startup detection based on installed AVI/WAV pairs.
- Adds NPC Bootups with YES MAN.
- Adds Faction Bootups with The Enclave and The Brotherhood of Steel.
- Renames the Deathclaw entry to Deathclaw Vault Experiment.
- Adds safe fallback to Default Bootup when a selected optional pack is removed.
- Adds startup playback reliability improvements for intermittent audio-only / black-screen boots.
- Keeps the Core mandatory while startup media is exposed through storageOptional.

1.0.0

https://github.com/CodyTolene/pip-boy-3000-holotapes/pull/79

- Initial public submission of PIP-CO Startup Systems.
- Adds Default Bootup, Mister Handy, Vault Girl, and Deathclaw Ripped Suit startup selections.
- Includes persistent selection and custom startup animation/audio assets.
